        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong> <br>Approximately 1.5 to 3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> <br>You step into an abandoned military base. <br>There, you will face unspeakable horrors… <br>and your only goal is to survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background</strong> <br>The story begins when a curious child enters a restricted military zone. <br>Inside, they experience terrifying events that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer’s Note</strong> <br><i>Frontier Outpost</i> is the very first horror game created by a solo developer who learned Unreal Engine through self-study. <br>The game may have many shortcomings, but this project represents my passion for learning and my determination to grow. <br>I want to continue making horror games and improve step by step. <br>If you share the same dream, feel free to reach out — I’m looking for people to join me on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distribution &amp; Streaming Guidelines</strong> <br>When streaming or uploading gameplay videos, please include the game’s title or a Steam link in the stream title or video description. <br>This small gesture means a lot to a solo developer. <br>The developer is not responsible for any damages or losses caused by the distribution of videos of this game.</p>",
